title: "Majere: Norwegian (Bokmål/Nynorsk) Language Models with Reliable Tool Calling on a Single 16 GB GPU"
type: software
version: "0.1"
abstract: "Evaluation and training of small local LLMs (4–14B) for Norwegian Bokmål and exact tool calling on a single 16 GB GPU. Baseline Qwen3.5-9B: 98.3% Norwegian, 81.7% right tool, 70.0% exact arguments."
